        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roata Mai</strong> is a high-octane, neon-soaked twist on the classic brick breaker formula — but instead of a ball, you're bouncing a deadly <strong>buzzsaw</strong> that slices through everything in its path!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission is to control the deflector platform and unleash chaos by ricocheting your saw into waves of enemies and breakable structures.</strong><br>Enemies won’t go down easily: some move erratically, others are armored from multiple sides, and a few even construct barriers mid-fight to block your attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of bouncing destruction, collect powerful upgrades, and survive the onslaught. Launch extra saws, expand your platform, or activate temporary boosts — but beware: <strong>not all power-ups are your friends</strong>. Some will shrink your paddle, steal your weapon, or cost you a precious life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, explosive, and endlessly satisfying — every level in <strong>Ammo Bounce</strong> is a neon battlefield of steel and reflexes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌀 Classic brick breaker action with a brutal twist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Deadly buzzsaw instead of a ball — shred your way through enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔧 Power-ups and debuffs that dramatically shift gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 Smart and varied enemy mechanics: movement, armor, barriers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎶 Pulse-pounding soundtrack and vibrant neon visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 Precision, reflexes, and chaos combined</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you control the storm of steel and become the true <strong>Master of the Saw</strong>?</p>",
